  "determination": true,
  "rationale": "`assets/skills/habeas/SKILL.md` is a bundled skill with front matter, so it is a site of `requirements.cli.skill_conventions`. Its `description` says when to use it in terms of the user's task: \"Use at the start of any work in a project that tracks requirements with Habeas\", with concrete markers of such a project. It also routes to other bundled skills by task (habeas-requirements, habeas-refactor, habeas-evidence, habeas-bootstrap-requirements) and says it is the reference for directive and reference syntax. The requirement allows naming other skills, so this is permitted. No obligation is unmet, and the site has no violation matches.",
